*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 9.33~13.33 seconds<sup>280f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
