*15 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*10 [[Dragon League Swordsman (Enemy)|Dragon League Swordsmen]] spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 0.33~1.67 seconds<sup>10f~50f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witches]] (100%) spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*15 [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witches]] (100%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
