**1 [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witch]] (400%) spawns.
**1 [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witch]] (400%) spawns.
**1 [[Dragon League Witch (Enemy)|Dragon League Witch]] (400%) spawns.

